<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61644" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαῖλαψ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰπος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>furious storm, hurricane</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαῖνον ἐρεμνῇ λαίλαπι ἶσοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					12.375
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κελαινῇ λ. ἶσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.747
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνεμος σὺν λαίλαπι πολλῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					17.57
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζέφυρος βαθείῃ λ. τύπτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.306
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζέφυρος μεγάλῃ σὺν λ. θύων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					12.408
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				426
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅτε τε Ζεὺς λαίλαπα τείνῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.365
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦρσεν ἔπι ζαῆν ἄνεμον . . λ.
					θεσπεσίῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					12.314
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				9.68
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς δ᾽ ὑπὸ λαίλαπι . . βέβριθε χθών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.384
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Semon.
				1.15
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νότου λαίλαπι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anacr.
					113
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαίλαπι χειμωνοτύπῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			 (anap.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jb.</u>
				21.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				30.11.6
			</span></i>; acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				395a7
			</span></i>, a <i>whirlwind sweeping upwards</i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτλης λαίλαπα δυσμενέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.147
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Arch.
			</span></i>).—Not found in early Prose, but common later, cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. ἀνέμου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Marc.</u>
					4.37
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Tim.</u>
				28
			</span></i>; spelt 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαῖλαμψ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Sammelb.</u>
					4324.15
				</span></i>
			:—a form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαιλαπετός</span></b> , ὁ, occurs in Sch.
			A <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				11.495
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
